WEBVTT

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.840
God!

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.740
D-Danichirou-sama!

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.050
Rea?

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.250
Rea!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.050
Danichirou-sama!

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.920
Thank goodness...

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.550
You're still alive.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:39.060
But... you're all bloody.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.180
Come, let's go to the hospital.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.440
Is something wrong?

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.940
You have no pulse!

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.540
It's just as if...

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.770
That is right, I died.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:58.450
And then I was reborn.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.860
What do you mean?

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.790
Wait! Don't go.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:04.210
My Rea...

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:09.530
No, I am no longer your daughter.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.270
Because...

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:13.510
...I am...

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.370
...no longer human.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:32.560
Why... did it turn out like this?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.910
Hey, have you heard?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:07.580
What?

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.710
Rea-sama has been sneaking out to see a guy recently.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:12.830
That's old news.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.920
You want to know what's happened recently?

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.300
Eh, what is it?

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.880
It seems Rea-sama has run away.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:20.510
Eh?!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.220
No way!

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.800
What do you mean by that?

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.850
A-Aria-sama... Welcome home.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.810
Welcome home.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.060
What do you mean Rea ran away?

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:37.480
When Danichirou-sama returned, he said that Rea ran away.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:40.990
How is he?

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:45.240
He has been in the bath the entire time since he returned.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.780
The bath?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.620
Move!

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.420
Quit just standing around!

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.460
Go tend to the garden or something!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.000
It's this early, and she already reeks of alcohol.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.510
Recently, she's been going to Host Clubs around noon.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.970
Host Club?

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.390
You know, since Danichirou-sama won't keep her company,

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.260
she's been frustrated.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.610
Dear!

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.490
What do you mean Rea ran away?

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.780
Even though she died,

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.740
she stood back up.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.580
Huh?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.580
She stood back up...

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.960
...and left me.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.830
What are you saying?

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.380
In any case, if she runs away,

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.590
it will ruin my reputation as the School Board Head!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.890
So, do you know where Rea is?

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:51.850
Most likely she's with a Shiyou High School boy named Furuya.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.420
Furuya?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:54.600
Who's he?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.610
Fu... ruya...

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.000
That's it.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.110
He...

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.910
That boy deceived my Rea.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.830
He's the source of all this evil.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.540
Furuya!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.210
Wait for me, Rea.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.880
I will free you from that bastard.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:26.800
With my love, I will once again purify your body and soul!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.760
At the Sanka Girls' Academy,

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.350
there is a special course called <i>meishin</i>.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:42.070
All of the students sew earnestly for 10 minutes before the first period.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.740
More than just learning how to sew,

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.400
it is a form of meditational training.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:50.740
The class is held without fail every morning.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:55.450
Furthermore, ever since I was a preschooler,

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:59.880
it's become a habit for me to perform <i>meishin</i> every morning.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.960
Ah, I see.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.380
So that's why you're able to sew your own wounds shut.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.930
As if!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.800
Ah, please hold it properly.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.760
Just a little bit more.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.660
I'm lucky that I can't feel any pain, aren't I?

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.290
You don't get it, do you?!

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.670
You really are dead!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.420
Your skin is cold, you have no pulse, and your pupils are dilated.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.630
How can you still laugh like this?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.510
Because...

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.260
Because this is the first...

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.270
The first time I have been in a boy's room.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.480
It makes me...

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.440
...happy.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.190
Huh?

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:08.440
Aw, it's finally over.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.240
Ranko-senpai!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:15.200
Do you want to get some sweets on the way home?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.080
I found a pretty stylish cafe.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.370
Sorry, I was planning on going straight home today.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:24.080
Ah, is that so?

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.300
That damn Chihiro.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.510
He was so caught up in chasing Babu-chan...

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.180
...that he abandoned me in that small hole.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.350
Unforgivable!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.850
I'll strangle him.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.560
What did you say?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.270
Ah, nothing!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.270
Huh?

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.280
The evening after rain is nice, is it not?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.000
Don't tell me, today she...

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:06.090
No, she <i>is</i> planning on freeloading here from now on.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.960
Hey, hey, Furuya-kun, can you see it?

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.760
Eh, I wasn't looking!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.630
Look, up in that tree over there,

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.050
it's Babu-chan.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.140
Over there.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:22.730
You're right. Geez, making me worry like that.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.440
Hey, Babu!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.690
Babu.

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.070
His irises are back to normal.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.820
Ba~bu.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.910
It seems Babu-chan has a stuffy nose. Is he okay?

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:39.540
Ah, he's been like that since I first met him.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.960
I even took him to the vet, but they couldn't cure it.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.830
He's always meowed like that.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.000
That's why he's Babu.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.880
Is that so?

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:52.880
Man, he has no idea how much trouble
he's caused us, and he's just lazing about.

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:56.390
Babu.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.680
Babu thinks that tree is the most comfortable.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:00.220
Eh?

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.930
You can understand what Babu is saying?

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:07.100
Somehow it seems like I can... you know?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.690
Is it possible that,

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.280
because they are both zombies, they
can somehow understand each other?

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.280
Speaking of which,

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:19.030
her personality hasn't changed much since she became a zombie.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:22.410
What is it?

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.370
No, it's nothing.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:31.920
Ah, were you thinking that I should act more like a zombie?

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.720
Like this... Just what Furuya-kun likes.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.970
You're plenty cute as you are.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:58.570
It really doesn't bother you that you've become a zombie?

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.360
Yes.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:03.240
After all, you said you will take responsibility.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.710
That is... How to say this...

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:12.380
How do you want me to take responsibility?

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.000
Eh?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.550
Usually, if you say "take responsibility"...

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.010
Hm, let me think.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:24.010
Go shopping with me, go to an art gallery...

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.470
Huh?

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:28.140
Also, let's go see a zombie movie.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.600
Um, what else?

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.980
That's right, an amusement park!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:32.270
What is she saying? It's as if we're just...
That's right, an amusement park!

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:35.610
A normal festival would be nice too.
What is she saying? It's as if we're just...

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.860
Basically, what I couldn't do up until now.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:44.830
Please let me experience everything normal girls do.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.840
Um...

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.290
Even though you're now a zombie,

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:57.340
you want to experience being a normal girl...

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.130
Huh, is something strange?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.090
Am I not allowed to?

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.520
No, it's not like you can't, but...

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.520
Such ridiculous strength.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.020
Furuya-kun...

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:17.030
I... some... how...

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.030
Hey, so sudden!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.040
Hey!

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:35.000
Chihiro, get out here!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.300
This is bad, it's Wanko.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.800
He finally shows himself.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.470
How dare you abandon me this morning!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.680
Hey, is there someone in your room?

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.060
No one's here. It's just me.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:50.350
I'm coming up, then.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:53.060
Let's talk about this outside.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:53.810
Why?

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.150
A guy has his reasons.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.480
At this point, finding a porn magazine wouldn't surprise me.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.150
Anyway, wait outside.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.780
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.410
I'm heading out for a bit.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.410
Don't leave this room.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.870
Got it?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.840
Hey, if we're going to talk, let's go to the riverbank!

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.630
Why the riverbank?

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.380
Just listen to me.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.510
Let's go, let's go!

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.550
Just then I...

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:31.560
What was I going to do with Furuya-kun...

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.940
This feeling is...

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:43.450
Sorry, I completely forgot I left you back there.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.370
You forgot?!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.030
Is that the only excuse you've got?

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.280
You're pissing me off!

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.540
Ow, ow, sorry, I was wrong!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.910
And how is Babu-chan?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.420
He seems okay.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.750
It's not like he's been attacking people or anything.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:05.090
Seriously, you need to get a cell phone.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.510
It's really troublesome at times like these.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.640
I don't need a cell phone.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.390
But what's going to happen to Babu-chan?

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.730
Is he going to remain immortal?

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.190
Something like that, I guess...

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.190
Hey, Furuya!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.570
What is this, now it's Yasutaka.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.330
Fu-ru-ya!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.950
You!

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.920
Please introduce me to Rea-tan too!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:38.920
Huh?

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.840
Furuya, you're a god!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.670
If you already knew her, why didn't you tell me?!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.260
Sick...

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:49.180
Yasutaka-kun is getting a little too reckless.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.930
Hey, by Rea, do you mean Sanka Rea-san?

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.390
That's right, that Sanka Rea-tan.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.100
What, so you already knew her?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.860
You kept asking "Do you know Sanka Rea?"

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.400
It's not as if I know her, we just met by chance.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.440
You bastard!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:05.990
What do you mean by chance?

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.910
You just hit the jackpot, and got close to her.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.160
Thank goodness he wasn't interested in just zombie women.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:16.410
No, I seriously live for zombie women.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:19.210
Daiichi, it's not like she's...

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.420
What's up?

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.250
Is it really not like that...?

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:27.920
Right now she's the zombie woman I have always wanted.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:30.090
That zombie girl's in my room?

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:34.310
Hey, now that I think about it, this is my dream situation!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.730
What are you grinning for?

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:39.060
I'm not.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.080
Furuya-kun... sure is slow.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.910
Who was that girl?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.880
She was wearing the Sanka uniform,

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.340
and they seemed really close.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.760
That's it, she must be Furuya-kun's...

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.930
At this point, finding a porn magazine wouldn't surprise me.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.070
That's right.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.610
Since it does not seem like there's anyone home...

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:55.680
Even though I'm a zombie, it should be okay to take a shower... I think.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:06.440
What is this strange feeling?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.730
Ah, that's it.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.650
I can't tell if the water is hot or cold.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.450
But it is refreshing.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.950
This is the first time I've been in such a small bathroom.

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:24.880
Hm?

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.260
I wonder what this is.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.340
What is it used for?

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:36.090
It's a bit hard and flexible...

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:40.470
Don't tell me, you use it like this to exercise...

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:43.640
Hm?

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.150
E-Erm...

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.820
Eh? Someone was home?!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:55.450
Ah! Sada, is that you, Sada?!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.180
Oh, Sada!

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.780
I see, you've been resurrected.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.160
No, I am...

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:04.040
Sada, I'm so sorry...

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.250
Um, you have the wrong person.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.180
I'm back.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:16.890
Sada!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.480
What's going on, Grandpa?

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.310
You've been resurrected.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:28.940
Sada, you've come back for me!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.780
I don't know anything about her being resurrected,

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:35.110
but wasn't grandma's name Kiyo, not Sada?

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.110
Eh, is that so?

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.370
Huh? What am I doing right now?

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.790
Good grief.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.120
I wonder if I have been exposed.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.630
Otou-sama must be having dinner about now.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.800
And here I am in someone else's home.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:02.010
A boy's room, no less.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.570
It was really busy today.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:15.190
Finally, I...

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.280
...have become free.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.910
From now on,

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.290
forever...

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:24.950
...just like this...

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.920
Somehow I was able to talk my way out of it.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:40.680
But that damn Yasutaka was quite persistent.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:45.680
He has no other way to use his pent up energy.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.770
Hey, Nii.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.690
We're having boiled animal intestines for dinner.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.030
Sorry, I'm not hungry.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.150
It doesn't seem like Mero found out.

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.120
Sorry I'm late-

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.370
Ah, welcome back.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:15.170
Hey, what's with that outfit?

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.920
Sorry, I was just borrowing your shower...

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.380
More importantly, you're still soaked.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.220
You'll catch a cold.

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:26.720
Ah, I'm fine.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:30.440
Since I'm a zombie, I can't catch a cold.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.060
Ah, that's right.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.820
Huh? Wait a moment, this conversation just now...

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.110
I'm having a conversation...

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.110
...with a moe zombie girl, just like I've always dreamt of!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.450
Uh, well then.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.490
Your stomach doesn't ever get upset either, does it?

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:53.540
Hm. Well, since I am a zombie, my stomach is broken.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.760
Bear with it!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.630
Furuya-kun?

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:04.800
Ah, sorry.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:08.390
I was so absorbed in my dream coming true that I lost myself.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:11.180
Anyway, hurry up and get dressed.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:14.900
Um, well, you see...

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:20.320
Honestly... I've been able to move less and less.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.660
It's as if my body's stiffening up.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.660
Eh? Stiffening?

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:30.450
Is that why you are slurring your words?

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:33.080
Yeah, something like that.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.540
What's going on?

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:37.380
It's as if the drug is wearing off.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.590
I'm going to touch you for a moment.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:47.510
Don't tell me it's...

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.350
...rigor mortis...

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:55.520
Rigor... mortis?

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.610
Yeah, that's probably what it is.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.650
Don't worry, it's a natural phenomenon.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:06.870
Hmm... As expected of... Furuya... kun...

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.740
You are well informed.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:11.750
Yeah.

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:17.540
Rea is so cheerful she doesn't even feel a thing,

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:22.840
but even if she is conscious her body is still that of a dead person.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:28.430
Then, if I just leave Rea alone,

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:30.890
her body will gradually start to rot away.

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.430
In less than a month, she'll be just bones...

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.520
I have to think of something.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:48.910
Please let me experience everything normal girls do.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.670
If I don't...

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.920
...protect Rea's body...

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:44.770
What? You'd like me to tone it down a bit?

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:46.940
I wonder what you mean by that.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:49.990
Eh, I'm out of character?

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:51.280
What do you mean?

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.280
I really am the same person.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:56.910
Next time: Sankarea.

00:23:56.910 --> 00:24:01.290
Episode 5: "Zombies are about".

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:03.290
Watch it, everyone!

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.100
Also, I'm still not convinced.

00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:09.630
Even if you tell me to put a damper on it, I'll still be troubled.
